Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:03.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,, Kon-Melo, Kon-Melo, Kon-Melo! It's ya Tech Wizardess MeloriTensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:08.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For those who have saw the Forza Horizon 5 highlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:09.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you might know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:12.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that I've dunked money by buying the game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:21.36,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Previously on Forza Horizon 5:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:18.23,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,284)}Jason 【Th3noscoper】 Gamma:\Nthere's no way she's gonna drill her bank\Naccount to buy the ultimate edition lol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did, I literally did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.17,Default Comic Sans MS (Funni),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&H11CCF4&}*ka-ching*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I drilled my bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:23.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The money dunking happens again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:26.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(839.6,635.2)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:29.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And today we'll be playing Forza Horizon 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:31.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(956.8,689.6)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:32.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To answer to many people, yes, I do have the premium
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,yes, I do have the premium edition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:34.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,just like many other people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:35.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,192)}All DLCs owned from\NPremium Edition\N(+ Treasure Map)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:35.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1269,825)}(But the Treasure Map won't be used\Nuntil we progress significantly into the game)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and currently it is prime time for Forza Horizon 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For whoever's playing the game right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy and have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,906)}"All Hail The Drift King"\N- Editor Mel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Specific message to RTGame. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, why you gotta be live almost the same time as I do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:48.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1320,548)}{\an5\ytshake}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:49.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He was live at the time I said that XD\N(No beef)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sit tight relax and um,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,we're getting into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:55.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:58.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So with great excitement, let's get right into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:00:59.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go
