Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:24.57,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:25.75,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\b1\pos(960,304)}Xbox Game Studios\N{\b0\c&HA3A3A3&}Presents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:26.60,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: I know you won't hear this until you land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.78,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\b1\pos(960,304)}A Playground Games\N{\b0\c&HA3A3A3&}Adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:32.22,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,But you are going to love it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:33.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"i want to see you suffer no assists\Nraw driving"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do that in a bit after we have our first run I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:36.73,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFE0DA0&\pos(960,244)}Aerostatikk (Mod){\c&HFFFFFF&}: i want to see you\Nsuffer no assists\N\Nraw driving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:41.87,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I have so much to show you, ugh, there's just not enough hours in the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.57,0:01:47.48,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,And guess what! Jordan will be here any minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh the Shinkansen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:54.15,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I've been busy getting everything ready, you got the sofa to crash on for a while and I got the garage all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:57.72,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Oh... he's here, gotta go...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:57.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:01.92,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Everything Mei said is true. You would not believe this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.13,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,I'll see you very soon! Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:06.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:09.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,'thought we're gonna... I thought we're starting already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:13.62,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: (excited pant) There's a huge event this weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:18.38,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Legends from all over, making their way to the Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:20.22,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be on another level!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:21.88,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I hope you're here in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.55,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Let me know when you get this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:30.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here we go. I saw 60 frames
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(712,849)}Hehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:34.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,'right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:37.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was an interesting start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:39.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean this is just like Forza Horizon 5
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,with the whole... umm..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,introduction starts with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,an already rolling start car
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:54.03,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,Bass Arena DJ: What up people, it's Scotty Tyler on Bass Arena and it is the start of a brand new day here at Horizon Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:03:00.47,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,So if you're listening in your car or you're kicking back on the bullet train. Well, enjoy your day.
