Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We almost... we almost RT'd it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:22.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It does feel a little ironic, doesn't it, that we're driving...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:30.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What seems to be an American vehicle in Japan for an introduction
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I gotta do a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(915,761)}Hahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:41.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do a little bit of drifting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(883,883)}Hehehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:47.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:48.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1115,880)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Right, what comes next?
