Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:57.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(742,936)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheheheyyyyy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:03.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang we don't get to drive that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:14.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Absolute Oblivion NPC moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:15.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(980,819)}Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:18.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it mind y'all, pedestrians?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:21.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If he's doing a burnout step the side the fuck away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1081,873)}Hehehahah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What a crazy start
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got the 911 GT from Porsche
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eueuueueuueueh~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:37.35,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,Gacha City Radio DJ: Sunglass wo kakete, issho ni uchiage party ni sanka shite ne!\N(Grab your sunglasses and join me at the launch party!)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,AHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:39.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(846,838)}Hahah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit
