Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:48.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"you were doing it like a stunt driver, 2 wheels"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:48.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1043,787)}Haha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:53.63,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,Launch Control: Heavy Lift Mission 358 no hassha ga seikou\Nshita koto ni yori, Horizon housou eisei wo kidou ni noseru koto ga dekimashita\N(Successful launch of Heavy Lift Mission 358,\Nboosting the Horizon Broadcast Satellite into orbit.)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:54.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hai!\N(Yes!/Aye!)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Itterasshai\N(See you~)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:01.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you in a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:05.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:06.33,Scott Tyler,,0,0,0,,Scott: And now? A Legend Convoy. Headed for the Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:06.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Aeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:10.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I never have a clean race ever on a Horizon intro
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:14.67,Scott Tyler,,0,0,0,,And leading the way, the AMAZING 2025 GR GT Prototype. Oh my word, just look at that think!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're ruining it, alright, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheheh, dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-weeeee~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we have jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There will never be a Horizon without jets, honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:37.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look in the cockpit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:40.25,Scott Tyler,,0,0,0,,I finally get to say it... Here it is! The Final stretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:45.70,Scott Tyler,,0,0,0,,Welcome! Everyone! To Horizon Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:51.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought that was a jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:54.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was just an entrance to the Horizon Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:56.23,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,Broadcast Presenter: That wraps up events for tonight at the Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:59.95,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,If you're out in the crowd wondering if you're Legend material, the Horizon Qualifiers are starting soon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:03.40,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,the Horizon Qualifiers are starting soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Are we dragging? (Drag racing*)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:12.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're not, it's just it's just a showcase. Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow what a T-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:21.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, a display and everything-
