Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:07:00.92,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(830,728)}Miku
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was not expecting that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:01.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I really wasn't-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"OMG IT MIGU"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:04.93,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFFAAFF&\pos(650,268)}squeakychair_ (Mod){\c&HFFFFFF&}: OMG IT MIGU
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1238,670)}Hehehehahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm curious to hear it now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:14.08,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Hey, I can't believe we're all here.\NMake yourself at home. Whatever you need, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:22.12,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Hey! Oh, we've talked about this for so long\Nand it's actually happening! So what's next, Mei?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.68,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Glad you asked...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:24.55,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFFAAFF&\pos(960,375)}squeakychair_ (Mod){\c&HFFFFFF&}: now you gotta get miku wraps for your car
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"now you gotta get miku wraps for your car" true
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:32.28,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I know the two of you dropped everything to be here. So, I got you both a little care package, everything you need to make the most of your time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.52,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,First things first
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.47,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,When in doubt, explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's fictional Tokyo, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:48.15,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I've been back here five years already, and I haven't even scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:48.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"please tell me ana says dayo at some point"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:50.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:50.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That would have been funny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:52.12,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,So, take this journal and document everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:53.95,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFE0DA0&\pos(960,244)}Aerostatikk (Mod){\c&HFFFFFF&}: please tell me ana says dayo at some point
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:53.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That would have been funny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:55.08,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what you both discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:58.15,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,And... I expect photographic evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:03.30,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Of course you need a guided tour... I've got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.32,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you both wanna earn some cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:08.07,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Well, with your driving skills, finding a job will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.57,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Tell me, what's the local racing scene like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:16.95,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: How about, Street Racing... at night... in Tokyo City.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:20.68,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't enough? I have one word for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:22.78,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Touge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Touge~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Touge~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully I can drift at all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:33.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Which would be a difficulty
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:38.02,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Hey, Mei, this is great, thanks. We couldn't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.73,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Though someone forgot to bring a car
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:44.92,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Don't worry. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What you got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:48.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Right let's have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:50.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What you got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, GMC of all cars. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:09:01.42,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Prepped these myself... and what's mine is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:06.83,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Take your pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So we got the Nissan Silvia
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Then we got the Toyota "Cecilia"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:11.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eh- C- Celica
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:12.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I can't freaking read
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:13.05,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,The other two you can use any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe... Celica "G4"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:17.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,A- GT-Four!
