Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:49.32,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let me introduct Yuji-san and Keiko-san. When they're not at the\Nworkshop perfecting their builds, they help set up races for the Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:59.42,Kono Yuji,,0,0,0,,Yuji: Please, just Yuji is OK. We have a new route here ready for testing. We need\Nyou to make sure it's fun; make sure it's Horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me writers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:03.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think you got...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:05.25,Tamaguchi Keiko,,0,0,0,,Keiko: Plus, it wouldn't really be Horizon if we didn't make it a race, so... up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.35,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Of course! Do you even need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're lacking pleasantries here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:11.58,Kono Yuji,,0,0,0,,Yuji: Well, I also need someone to test the tune on my R32...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:15.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be introducing people by the first name when they first met
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:16.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,when they first met
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,way too casual now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:28.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You know what screw it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:33.87,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Remember this is a race, so... no holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:35.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Repair costs be damned, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:37.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1480,792)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, see if we can catch up-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,catch up to Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yuji~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:45.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was the hardest pillar I've ever hit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:51.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1513,659)}Hohohoho
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:52.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What?
