Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:53.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1449,844)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:14:59.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:00.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1537,617)}Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:04.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's probably a rubber banding effect for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, for the race.
