Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Horizon Marshal???
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:22.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What, the Marshal got second place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:24.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How is this fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:27.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like- Sounds like a safety car is cheating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:37.63,Kono Yuji,,0,0,0,,Yuji: OK, looks like the route walks well. As does the tune on that R32. Good work, everyone. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:38.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1394,705)}(losing her drink)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:42.38,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Getting to race on an actual Horizon track was thank enough! It's all practice, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:43.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how wrecked my car is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehaha-ha
