Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.55,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Mei, this is amaing! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:50.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That is so wrecked!
