Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:59.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like why is it defeating all of our side characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:03.82,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Welcome to the Spring Qualifiers, our path to the festival and our first Wristband
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:07.55,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Standing in our way is the Horizon Invitational.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:17.04,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFE0DA0&\pos(960,300)}Aerostatikk (Mod){\c&HFFFFFF&}: you see, th\Ncrumble zone=whole car
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:12.47,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,So, we need to prove ourselves first, in these Qualifier events.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:13.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"th crumble zone=whole car"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,True
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:19.15,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Complete enough of these and we'll have a place in the Invitational. First step on the road to Legend Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:21.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Le-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:22.05,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Better get to it. What do you want to do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:26.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Legend Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:29.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the flip-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:30.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the flipping phone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by Legend Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:35.27,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00F1FC&}New Region Discovered\N{\c&HFFFFFF&}Minamino Region
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:35.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Minamino-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Mi- mi- I can't freaking read
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:37.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have not
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:41.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did not fully digest what was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:42.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(grunts)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:44.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Saved it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:45.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1529,659)}Heheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:46.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To an extent
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:46.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1481,723)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:49.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We just had a little scratch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:49.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tis-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:52.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tis nothing but a scratch, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:55.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.95,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Horizon Qualifiers start here. See you at the starting grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only car I have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We will have to get to the next Horizon lat-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:09.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh once we're done with the uh those three races
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:11.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Those three races done we're gonna get to the next Horizon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then we're gonna start shopping
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How do I switch musics?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No! That's- that's freaking photo mode
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1523,704)}Heheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got into photo mode by accident
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:24.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,This car can't handle...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:25.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nor can it power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:27.38,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6073F3&}Vivek Ponnusamy (Co-driver): OOOUGHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It does none of the sort
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.53,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6073F3&}Samir, Samir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:29.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Awh, dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:30.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,250)}Clipper Aero notes: MEL! you're breaking the car!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:30.00,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6073F3&}You're breaking the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We need a car
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We- We sorely need a car
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like not this car, but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:38.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,THE car that we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:44.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, this car is so crumpled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:47.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in for a clean race
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:51.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in for just power and power and power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:55.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to equate myself to anyone from Top Gear
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:59.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:03.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to cars, I think I'll be heavily Jeremy Clarkson
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:04.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1411,648)}Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:08.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just speed and power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:12.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"can't wait to see a full grid of panda truenos
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:16.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in S class all having skill issues in unison"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:17.77,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HFFAAFF&\pos(960,175)}vitoromega13{\c&HFFFFFF&}: can't wait to see a\Nfull grid of panda truenos in S class all\Nhaving skill issues in unison
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:18.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That would have been funny honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:30.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,My god, I'm dead last
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"i think the statement of being like clarkson is not correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,clearly got the speed of james may"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:38.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that's true
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:40.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead last!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:42.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm obsessed with speed and power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:43.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But I-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:45.98,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&H4D24ED&\pos(960,175)}thecarrot978{\c&HFFFFFF&}: i think the\Nstatement of being like clarkson is not\Ncorrect, clearly got the speed of james\Nmay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:45.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But I end up becoming James May basically
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:47.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:48.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see
