Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:49.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We'll try out the dirt racing then
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:55.70,ANNA,,0,0,0,,ANNA: OK, Miku
